      "owner_directive": "Sweep broadened by the owner to every reachable instance of the partial-identity bug class. Fixed here: plot input resolution and target discovery (plot/runtime.py, plot/targets.py); per-workflow frontend execution state; project-scoped run registry with all_workflow_runs for backend-wide sweeps; run-scoped MCP block-error capture; workflow-scoped tutorial port_has_output and rendered_plots; workflow-scoped DataPreview plot match; project-scoped git history cache; prompt-scoped interactive memory write; unique workflow tab ids plus a preview tab's backingTabId. Deferred with rationale in #2364: the protected-core type-registry singleton and retention keying, the frontend catalog latches, and three cosmetic same-family matches.",
